    0.8.4-dev - 2026/05/11 (04ae8b8) [develop]
        :brief strict acceptance 锁定 verified source final gate
        - test(acceptance): final-export-pass-run 读取 live benchmark summary，断言 final_export=final、failed_checks empty、SourceEvidenceManifest.v1 存在、final gate passed
        - fix(runtime): PaperRun JSON 原子写入使用唯一 tmp 文件名，并对 Windows EPERM/EBUSY/EACCES/ENOTEMPTY replace 失败做短退避重试
        - fix(acceptance): benchmark summary 使用 UTF-8 显式读取，避免中文默认语言在 Windows PowerShell 5.1 下被 ANSI 解码破坏
        - test(runtime): 新增真实文件系统并发 writeJsonAtomic 测试，防止 PaperRun 状态写入在 live run 中竞态失败
        - test(strict): focused strict server tests 纳入 runtime-state，并锁定完整 stdout 解析与 source evidence assertions
        :src
            - scripts/strict-acceptance.ps1 - live benchmark summary helper, source evidence final gate assertions, full stdout capture, UTF-8 summary parsing
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/research/runtime/state.ts - unique tmp atomic writes and retrying replace for Windows file locks
            - packages/opencode/test/paper/runtime-state.test.ts - real filesystem concurrent writeJsonAtomic regression
            - packages/opencode/test/paper/strict-acceptance.test.ts - strict acceptance source-gate and UTF-8 parser coverage
        :reports
            - reports/strict-live-acceptance.md - focused strict live acceptance passed with topic/code/final PaperRun benchmark checks
        :verification
            - npx --yes bun@1.3.13 --cwd packages/opencode test test/paper/runtime-state.test.ts test/paper/paperrun-execution.test.ts passed: 4 pass, 0 fail
