    0.8.3-dev - 2026/05/11 (76500fa) [develop]
        :brief 最终导出 source authenticity gate 硬化
        - feat(verification): final export 现在要求引用来源必须 clear license 且 verification.status=verified
        - feat(orchestrator): 新增 SourceEvidenceManifest.v1 ingestion，从 paper_files/experiment_logs 读取用户或工具提供的验证来源清单
        - feat(claim-ledger): 默认 ClaimLedger 只绑定 clear+verified source，未验证 seed 不能支撑 final claims
        - test(paperrun): final export pass 场景同时提供 SourceEvidenceManifest 与 ExperimentEvidenceManifest
        - test(verification): reproduction pass 但 source 未验证时 final export 被阻断
        - chore(benchmark): live final benchmark 生成 verified source evidence，避免把未验证 search seed 当作最终论文证据
        :src
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/orchestrator.ts - SourceEvidenceManifest.v1 loading, verified source binding, final benchmark support
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/research/verification/checks.ts - unverified_source/source_license_failure blockers
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/research/verification/gate.ts - source authenticity checks in final gate
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/research/verification/schemas.ts - source_records and new finding categories
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/authoring.ts - passes source records into final authenticity gate
            - scripts/live-paper-quality-benchmark.ts - final scenario includes verified source manifest
