    0.8.2-dev - 2026/05/11 (b83f8de) [develop]
        :brief 全仓 strict acceptance 验收硬化
        - test(acceptance): 全量 packages/opencode test 纳入 strict-live-full 正式验收并通过 2586 pass / 0 fail
        - fix(test): paper/research 临时目录清理加入 Windows EBUSY/EACCES/EPERM 重试与警告降级，避免清理句柄竞争污染产品断言
